Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.31,0:00:06.23,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt, if you're going to live here in Maalt,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:09.44,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,you absolutely cannot refuse \Na request from the Latours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.13,0:00:11.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I have no intention of refusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:15.02,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But... is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:18.50,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Um... you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:23.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If they find out I'm a \Nmonster, they'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:25.85,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It's going to be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:32.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, when I met Isaac, he didn't \Nseem to care about my appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:35.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If it was an issue, he wouldn't \Nhave made the request at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.32,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:41.25,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But if there's any problem at all, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:44.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course. I'll start \Nby paying them a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:58.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This place is incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:05.74,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I like to think I have a good \Nsense of direction, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:10.32,Flashback,Guard,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:15.37,Flashback,Guard,0,0,0,,The sun won't help you. I suppose \Nthat's enough of a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:19.68,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,There are very few places in the \Nlabyrinths where you can see the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:22.33,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even without the sun to \Nguide them, an adventurer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:24.64,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,can draw a mental map to guide them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:29.75,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But if the map in my head was right, I \Nwould've made it to the exit a long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:42.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This isn't the exit, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:51.71,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Will you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:56.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, I'm going to keep \Ntrying a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.11,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Or is that not okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:00.60,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Head that way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:04.09,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Be warned, though, that the maze \Nwill continue for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:11.10,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,If you'd like to take a break, why \Ndon't you join me for a spot of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll do that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.91,0:03:50.08,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\an1\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,400)\c&H343232&\3c&H646D76&\b1\pos(482.232,274.724)}The Garden\NLabyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:51.72,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I assume she's a daughter \Nof the Latour family, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:55.98,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The teapot she's using is a \Nmagic item, as well, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:04:01.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but did you forget \Nto put in the tea leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:11.51,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,This teapot can recreate the taste of any \Ntea that it's ever been used to brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:14.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's an incredible item. \NWhere did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:18.27,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,There are two types of magic items: \Nones from the labyrinths,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:21.44,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,and those made by craftsmen \Nto imitate the former.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:25.91,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,This one was discovered 200 \Nyears ago in the labyrinths.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:30.30,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I believe it was worth around 300 platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:32.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Platinum?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:35.22,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,You could live a lifetime off of just one \Nplatinum coin and have money left over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:37.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And it cost 300 of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:40.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The Latour family is a lot wealthier \Nthan most nobles, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:43.11,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It's more than worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:48.14,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Adventurers risked their lives \Nin the labyrinths to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:50.71,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can risk your life in the labyrinths
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:53.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,and only end up with a bunch \Nof weird junk, though, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:58.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:01.28,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:05.83,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I've recreated a tea I had long ago,\Nthe one whose taste I liked best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:09.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've never had tea this good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:15.40,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,This may be rude, but is that \Nmask also a magic item?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:16.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.90,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.12,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:24.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Someone I know bought it from \Na street stall in Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:27.13,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And for three bronze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:30.25,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I had no idea there was something so \Nfascinating to be found in Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:33.66,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to ask, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.15,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to part with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:40.50,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I heard the Latours collect magic items.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:42.00,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Does she collect them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:47.37,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's a valuable item, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:50.96,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm more than willing \Nto pay what it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.86,0:05:52.98,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd love to sell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:54.65,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If I could only take it off...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:06:00.96,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But it's only thanks to this mask \Nthat nobody can see I'm undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.81,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:04.92,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:08.97,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure it must be an item \Nof great importance to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:12.39,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It was rude to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:15.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:19.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you for the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:22.05,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Take care, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:23.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:27.32,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:29.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A hint?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.84,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,You should avoid looking \Nat the sun, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The sun, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:50.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's definitely some trick to this maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:55.23,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The sun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:05.86,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:11.20,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Teleportation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.66,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can you go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:17.00,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, there might be one-way teleporters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:22.06,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not even in a labyrinth... So \Nhow could there be traps like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.52,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:26.59,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm starting over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:43.74,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm finally out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.74,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:50.56,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It seems you found the secret of the maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.09,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's thanks to the advice \Na certain someone gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:08:00.29,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm Laura Latour, the head \Nof the Latour family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:02.65,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,A pleasure to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:05.34,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She's the head of the family?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:09.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm Rentt Vivie. A Bronze-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:12.09,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I came to discuss a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:13.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I completed the maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.98,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Indeed you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:23.49,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Very few are capable of doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:26.39,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Do I get a reward, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.50,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:36.09,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Please choose any magic item you want \Nfrom the Latour Family's collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:40.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Then can you give me the \None that made that maze?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:44.78,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:47.98,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:51.43,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You made me walk forever in that labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It was my way of getting back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.86,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,You're a fascinating man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:00.48,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:18.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Magic items made by human \Nhands are more consistently reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:24.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But we can still only make the \Nsimplest items, like these lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.25,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,They're filled with mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.28,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Just like the labyrinths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.12,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.46,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,These are all magic items?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:47.85,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes. It was very difficult to get \Nthem all cleaned up and organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:52.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I \Nmeant... well, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:58.81,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,How are all the labyrinths around \Nthe world born? Why do they exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.82,0:10:03.98,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,No one has ever found an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:06.46,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,The magic items are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:13.54,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Just as you said, some of them are junk \Nthat we have little idea how to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:18.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What is this item?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.76,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:22.44,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,If you throw it, it will \Ncontinue to bounce forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:25.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why did you collect all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.18,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Because I wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:30.27,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,That's what it means to \Nbe an obsessive collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:32.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:34.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:38.69,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen the airships \Nthey have in the west?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:44.41,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,They're huge, and carry people \Nwith the power of steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:50.73,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It's a model of one of them. \NIt's powered by mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.20,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,You can control it with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:03.73,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Is it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.71,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes. I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:08.01,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Then will you choose this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:13.73,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want it, but it's a toy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:18.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The young boy inside me wants it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:22.16,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The grown up inside me wants \Nsomething more useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.92,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,You seem hesitant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:29.41,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Rentt, focus your mind on the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.36,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Amazing, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:41.76,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,The controller can transfer \Ntheir mind into the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes, that's amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:46.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But it burns a lot of mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.17,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I call it a "model", for \Nlack of a better term,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:51.77,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,but this was discovered in the labyrinths.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:53.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:58.34,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes. The airships are \Nmodeled after this item.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:01.85,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Though they could never \Nfigure out what made it fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:04.21,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,and were forced to turn to other means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:07.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a toy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:10.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But it would be very helpful for scouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.68,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:16.54,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,But because of the way it uses mana, \Nyou can't send it that far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:17.92,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:21.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It couldn't go more than a \Nfew minutes with my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:22.51,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:25.46,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:27.94,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Take your time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:29.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:34.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's a lot ahead too, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:38.34,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is this a magic item as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:41.41,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes. It lights up when something approaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.78,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes. It will react even to a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:48.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sounds useful, but I don't know \Nif it actually would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:52.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This seems to be a normal painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:58.69,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Press the button on the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:00.94,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:09.36,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Isn't it intriguing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:11.96,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,What do you think those voices are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:15.23,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is she just enjoying watching my reactions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:21.03,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Rentt, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:27.24,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Isaac, where's the shutdown device?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:30.94,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,We put it somewhere else, just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.41,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,You're kidding me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.49,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why is there a golem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.94,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even I couldn't take a \Nhit from this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:08.42,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Isaac, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:09.66,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.10,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Rentt, just try and hang \Nin there for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:13.94,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,It should be around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's important to keep things organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:24.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey, how long can a golem stay powered?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:27.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It only took a little bit of my mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:30.27,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,It only used your mana to activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:34.65,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,That golem absorbs the mana and inorganic \Nmatter in its surroundings to become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:40.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can I hurt it a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:42.30,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:44.98,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,But you won't be able \Nto defeat it in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:47.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not planning on beating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:00.58,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:05.97,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Golems have a word in a magical tongue \Non their forehead that means "truth."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:10.39,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You can add a single character \Nto change that word to "death,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.85,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,which will cause it to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:14.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's nothing on its forehead at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:24.70,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,At least, that's how they did \Nit in the very early days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:27.62,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Normally they come with an \Nexternal shutdown device.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:28.93,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,And if it doesn't have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.94,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Then you have to run, or defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey, have you found that shutdown device yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:38.13,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it was on this shelf...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, I can't keep this up any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:50.80,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I didn't want to show anyone this \Ntechnique, but... I have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.13,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Mana-Spirit Fusion will do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:01.66,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So they made it in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:13.12,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.37,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:19.54,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,My failure to properly manage our \Nmagic items has put you in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:23.21,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,No, as your master, it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:27.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, it's my fault for carelessly \Ntouching a magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:29.92,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:33.20,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They're not gonna ask me \Nto pay for it, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:38.10,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'll have the servants clean this up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:41.93,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Now, what magic item will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:45.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'd like to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.60,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:57.28,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Materials taken from monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:17:02.11,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,They're not magic items, but they can be used to make medicine and weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.12,0:17:05.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Materials taken from monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.13,0:17:19.85,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Does that catch your interest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:26.89,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It's the blood of a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:38.23,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ingesting the blood of a vampire is \Nsaid to make one a vampire themself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.12,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.94,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It's just a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:46.21,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,There are quite a few records of \Npeople drinking vampire blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:49.59,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Most of them went mad and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:53.67,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,The few who survived are said to have become \Nhollow shells of their former selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:58.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So nobody was ever able to \Nbecome a vampire, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:02.51,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Do you think anyone would ever \Nsay they've become a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:05.42,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,They would immediately be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:06.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.78,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,So there's just rumors, and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:14.87,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,But even rumors are enough to make it \Ndesired among those who wish for eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:18.49,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,You can sell it for a fortune \Nto the high nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:22.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've made my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And this is what you chose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:31.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:33.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yes, it's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:46.69,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I've seen airships, but I had no idea \Nthey were inspired by a magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:56.89,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And not only can you control \Nit, you can see what it sees?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's a ton of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:03.07,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Who are the Latour family, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:05.65,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They're freer with gifts than many royals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:08.76,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, there aren't many\Nadventurers like me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:12.17,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,who make regular trips \Nto the Tarasque swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:16.22,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I can really take this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:20.35,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Yes. It's thanks for taking \Non such a troublesome job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:27.01,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Of course, we'll pay you what's on the job \Nsheet each time you complete the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.01,0:19:28.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:32.30,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Now I can devote myself \Nfully to caring for Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:35.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So, you want to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:43.09,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Of course... but I think first it's \Ntime to stop playing and face reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:46.34,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I wasn't just playing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:05.10,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Was he to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:07.43,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Is that how it seems to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:08.39,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:11.49,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,He was a rare sort of guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.49,0:20:13.55,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I let myself get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:16.06,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,It was a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:20.25,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,But for now, \Nplease get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:25.83,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's safe to assume this is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:28.46,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,When I saw this, I could feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:36.23,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If I drink this, I knew, \Nsomething would change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:39.99,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Something instinctive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:41.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:44.75,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Just as Laura Latour said,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:50.94,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,the records say that everyone who ingests \Nvampire blood meets a terrible end...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:54.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.05,0:20:56.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's rare for you to be hesitant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:20:59.18,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd be lying if I said I wasn't scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.37,0:21:03.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I know I need this if I'm going to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:06.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,My body wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.43,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:11.49,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You may not survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.47,0:21:16.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even if your undead body can take it, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:21.53,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If you can avoid drinking \Nit, I'd prefer you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.79,0:21:27.58,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind you being an undead forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:34.38,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Just stay here forever and spend \Nyour life as an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:36.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:40.44,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But that's not what you want, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:45.03,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even if you don't have the talent, \Neven if it takes you years...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:47.98,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You want to become one \Nno matter what, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:50.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,A Mythril-class adventurer...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:39.97,Title,Lorraine,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs33\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\b0\pos(230.367,281.286)}Rentt Faina
